    "body": "This PR movs \"stars\" from the `preferences.grafana.app` into a new `collections.grafana.app` apiserver.  This will allow the distinct concepts to evolve independently (eg, changes to stars or preferences do not require bumping the version for the other value)\r\n\r\nThis also *removes* the query history stars support -- that feature will be deprecated and removed, so we do not need to migrate it\r\n\r\nNOTE: this requires running in dev mode and:\r\n```\r\n[feature_toggles]\r\nstarsFromAPIServer = true\r\nkubernetesStars = true\r\ngrafanaAPIServerWithExperimentalAPIs = true\r\n```\r\n\r\n| Before | After|\r\n| :------- | :------: |\r\n | <img width=\"800\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7757905-e5b5-4c4c-98d1-966f3db73ee3\" /> |  <img width=\"800\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/192d49a0-c227-4b19-a932-b109298a3a12\" />  <img width=\"800\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42be52c6-fc56-4e93-9de8-880b9d232314\" /> |\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
